  partName: Intake Manifold
  description: The Intake Manifold, located at the top-left-rear of the Hover Engine,
    is a complex-shaped component responsible for distributing air and fuel to the
    engine's cylinders. Its medium size and standard surface material allow for efficient
    airflow and durability. Interestingly, the Intake Manifold's design must be carefully
    optimized to minimize pressure drops and maximize engine performance.
